import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact FC Mobile Tools and TanzimFC.">
  <article class="wrap legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">LEGAL / CONTACT</p>
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">Last updated: October 9, 2026</p>
    <p>Use the official TanzimFC channels below for questions, corrections, privacy requests, copyright concerns, or creator enquiries.</p>

    <section><h2>Official channels</h2><div class="legal-links"><a href="https://discord.com/invite/B4a7AxuU69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord Community</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@tanzimfc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube</a><a href="https://x.com/TanzimFC" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X / Twitter</a></div></section>

    <section><h2>Corrections and technical issues</h2><p>Please report incorrect OVR or player information, expired redeem codes, broken calculators, outdated event information, broken links, account access issues, missing quest progress, survey problems, incorrect Token or XP records, or other site issues. Include the relevant page or feature and enough detail for us to reproduce or review the issue. Do not include passwords, authentication tokens, or other sensitive credentials.</p></section>

    <section><h2>Privacy requests</h2><p>If you have a privacy question or want to request access to, correction of, or deletion of information you directly provided to FCMOBILETOOLS, contact us through an official channel and clearly identify the nature of the request. We may ask for reasonable information to verify that you control the relevant account or data, and some records may need to be retained for security, reward accounting, disputes, or legal obligations. Do not send passwords, authentication tokens, payment information, or unnecessary sensitive information.</p></section>

    <section><h2>Copyright and intellectual property</h2><p>If you believe material on the site infringes your copyright or another applicable right, contact us with the relevant URL, a description of the material, information supporting your rights, and enough information for us to review the claim. See <a href="/legal/copyright">Copyright &amp; Intellectual Property</a>.</p></section>

    <section><h2>Creator and partnership enquiries</h2><p>Creator applications, editorial corrections, collaboration requests, sponsorship or partnership enquiries, and other business-related messages may be sent through the official channels. Submission does not guarantee a response, publication, partnership, or compensation.</p></section>

    <section><h2>EA account support</h2><p>FC Mobile Tools cannot access, recover, ban, unban, transfer, refund, or otherwise administer EA accounts. For account recovery, bans, purchases, refunds, payment issues, or official account support, contact EA through its official support channels.</p></section>

    <section><h2>What to include</h2><p>For faster review, include the page URL or feature name, a short description of the issue, relevant screenshots where useful, and any non-sensitive steps needed to reproduce it. We may ignore or restrict abusive, threatening, spam, malicious, or clearly irrelevant communications.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
